      <title>腾势N8全新内饰明确科技新奢路线，后续车型将全面延续</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260905/%E8%85%BE%E5%8A%BFN8%E5%85%A8%E6%96%B0%E5%86%85%E9%A5%B0%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E6%96%B0%E5%A5%A2%E8%B7%AF%E7%BA%BF%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E8%BD%A6%E5%9E%8B%E5%B0%86%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E5%BB%B6%E7%BB%AD/</link>
